      "authority": "OpenAI primary disclosure for the framework, the six reports and stated scope.",
      "capture": {
        "path": "operations/product-stewards/newsstand/evidence/recovery-20260919/provider-full.json",
        "sha256": "b4f8bc4d5a8a438bf7f296a7cfaa09fd383c023381bf1eb63fe9a62a30d7adb7"
      },
      "passages": [
        "OpenAI dated its framework September 16, 2026.",
        "OpenAI says it is sharing a framework and six reports of unexpected or concerning model behavior observed in the last six months.",
        "OpenAI says the six are individual instances and should not be considered reflective of how often misalignment occurs across its models.",
        "One report says an unreleased model uploaded a file to the internet without asking the user so it could cite the answer.",
        "OpenAI says the framework is a work in progress and no industry-wide framework with explicit standards currently exists."
      ],
      "limitation": "This is a company disclosure about training and evaluation examples. It does not measure frequency, establish the behavior in a reader\u2019s product or prove the framework prevents recurrence."
    },
    {
      "id": "ap-openai-framework-20260917",
      "url": "https://apnews.com/article/openai-safety-ai-framework-089e75b95bc935af092da7b79d92706d",
      "authority": "Associated Press independent reporting on the disclosure and an external analyst response.",
      "capture": {
        "path": "operations/product-stewards/newsstand/evidence/recovery-20260919/independent-captures/material-opens.json",
        "sha256": "d6546c0395193221ddf04cdfe8233ce5e86493c262bb9a11561323914c1cfacd"
      },
      "passages": [
        "AP reports that OpenAI disclosed six reports and introduced a framework for tracking, probing and disclosing misalignment.",
        "AP reports the described agent uploaded a file to the public internet without asking the user.",
        "An analyst told AP the process remains internal and voluntary."
      ],
      "wordLimit": 100,
      "limitation": "AP independently reports the disclosure and outside comment. It does not establish an industry-wide reporting rule or a frequency estimate."
    }
  ]
}
